  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Randall Glave and Rena Tamil are a couple that travels the world in search
    of adventure.



    Every day they find a new monster to slay, a new ancient
    dungeon to discover, and so on.



    Eventually the couple decides their days
    of adventures shall end, however. Even the wildest people settle down at the
    end.



    Though it is short lasted, as they are contacted by a group that
    requires strong willed individuals.



    It is revealed that in a month or
    so, a great evil will be rising to seek a thing called the "God orbs". This evil
    seeks to become some sort of God this way.



    It is up to the people in this
    group to create a power to stop this evil.



    There are ten duos of people,
    each different type of creature (elves, centaurs, angels, etc). They each are
    instructed throughout a long ritual to think about a virtue their kind represents.



    Pondering
    their travels, Randall and Rena think to all of the death they discovered humans
    bring upon each other.



    This ritual bestowed to each of the duos a "mystic
    eye" to represent the value they believe their people show, resulting in Randall
    and Rena gaining the purple eye of death.



    These "mystic eyes" come with
    many abilities depending on their virtues, and they are said to be the key to
    defeating this evil.



    However in the month leading up to the rising of
    evil creatures, Rena was discovered to be pregnant with her first child.



    As
    distorted monsters begin to appear all over the Earth, Randall tells Rena to
    stay home...



    Though their power is meant to be used together, Randall
    believes he is strong enough to repel the forces of evil without his partner
    for the sake of her safety...






    PRESS ESC TO START'
